Salesforce DX, CLI, and GitHub form the foundation of modern Salesforce development. Together, they enable developers to work efficiently, collaborate effectively, and deploy applications safely. Understanding these tools is essential for building enterprise-grade solutions that are scalable, reliable, and easy to maintain.
